    <string name="experimental_notice_body">Some features and UI flows in this version need extra testing.\n\nPlease send feedback if something feels wrong with:\n• Location-based schedules\n• Advanced / ADB tools\n• Device admin features\n• The new Home / Blocking / Manage / Settings menu layout\n• Manage keys actions for NFC tags, paired tags, QR codes, and barcodes\n• Local backup / restore behavior\n• App lock and uninstall protection\n\nThese may behave differently depending on your device, especially on Xiaomi, Samsung, and other OEM-customized Android versions.\n\nYou can still use Switchly normally — core blocking is stable.</string>

